nfo><cntAdress><city>Ispra</city><country>Italy</country></cntAdress></rpCntInfo></idPoC><idAbs>The purpose of the European River Catchments (ERC) is to provide a homogeneous European catchments dataset at scale 1:1 million that can be used together with the digital topographic data of EuroGlobalMap.

The European River Catchments were created using as main input the River and Catchment Database for Europe (source: Joint Research Centre) version 2.0, extracting watersheds order 5 (CCM2 wso5) and RiverBasins. The coastline of the European River Catchments was extracted from the EuroGlobalMap water lines dataset version 1.1 (source: Eurogeographics). Manual editing, based on different national and international information sources, was needed to obtain data consistency with EuroGlobalMap. 

